				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Theres no synchronization between both b-threads, so each run may produce a different order:  sometimes \"Hello World\", sometimes \"World Hello\".\r\r\rAnd that's perfectly fine — because each behavior acts independently. What we have so far is **pure concurrency without coordination**."
			},
